---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import NavBar from '../components/NavBar.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About DevSubnet â€“ Free IP Subnet Calculator Tool"
  description="DevSubnet is a free, privacy-first IP subnet calculator and CIDR planner built for network engineers, sysadmins, and cloud architects. All calculations run locally in your browser."
>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <NavBar path='about' />

    <main class="page-main">
      <div class="content-container">
        <!-- Breadcrumb -->
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <strong>About Us</strong>
        </nav>

        <section class="page-header">
          <div class="eyebrow">OUR MISSION</div>
          <h1>About devsubnet.com</h1>
          <p class="lede">
            We build next-generation, client-side tools to simplify complex network calculations.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="page-body">
          <div class="card-grid">
            <div class="info-card">
              <h2>Who We Are</h2>
              <p>
                devsubnet.com was founded by a group of network engineers and cloud architects who grew tired of using slow, cluttered, ad-heavy subnet calculators from the early 2000s. We set out to create a modern, elegant, and lightning-fast alternative built for modern developer and DevOps workflows.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
              <h2>Privacy First</h2>
              <p>
                Unlike traditional calculators that send your queries to a server, devsubnet.com runs <strong>entirely in your browser</strong>. All IP mathematical operations, CIDR conversions, and visual splits are calculated locally. No analytics track your IP ranges, and no data ever leaves your device.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="text-block">
            <h2>The Technology</h2>
            <p>
              devsubnet.com is built using Astro and TypeScript. By omitting heavy server-side requirements and rendering static assets with lightweight JavaScript, we achieve near-instant page transitions, responsive dark mode support, and seamless interactive visual tools like our recursive subnet splitter.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="page-cta">
          <a href="/" class="btn-return">â† Return to Calculator</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>DEVSUBNET.COM / ENGINEERED FOR CLEAR NETWORKS</span>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/about">About Us</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms & Conditions</a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
      </div>
      <span>NO DATA LEAVES YOUR DEVICE</span>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-main {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }

  .content-container {
    max-width: 54rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .breadcrumb a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .breadcrumb .sep { color: var(--text-secondary); }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .page-header .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .page-header .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .page-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .info-card {
    background-color: var(--card-bg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03));
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .info-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .info-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .text-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .text-block p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .page-cta {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  .btn-return {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--text-primary);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .btn-return:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  /* Theme Toggle */
  .theme-toggle {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast), color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .theme-toggle:hover {
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .theme-toggle .sun { display: none; width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; }
  .theme-toggle .moon { display: block; width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; }

  :root[data-theme="light"] .theme-toggle .sun  { display: block; }
  :root[data-theme="light"] .theme-toggle .moon { display: none; }
</style>

<script>
  const themeBtn = document.getElementById('theme-btn');
  if (themeBtn) {
    themeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const doc = document.documentElement;
      const next = doc.getAttribute('data-theme') === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light';
      doc.setAttribute('data-theme', next);
      localStorage.setItem('devsubnet-theme', next);
    });
  }
</script>
